Rename history
--------------

    dsh-windows-mcp      (upstream, helloHub1212)      the original package
      -> dsh-desktop-bridge                            first fork, identity renamed
      -> dsh-windows-control                           this repository

The rename is not cosmetic: from `dsh-windows-control` on, the package also
ships a native Win32 fast path (`lib/fastpath.js`, `tools/fastpath-host.ps1`)
alongside the official MCP bridge, so the name describes the control channel
rather than the MCP transport.

The original copyright notice and the full MIT permission notice are retained
verbatim in `LICENSE`, as the license requires for copies and substantial
portions of the software.

Modifications in this repository (package identity, route prefix, state file
names, repository metadata, fast path) are released under the same MIT License.
